---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="trust" class="py-20 lg:py-24 bg-white border-b border-subtle">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 space-y-3 scroll-reveal">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700">
        <span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600"></span>
        <span>Commercial Integrity</span>
        <span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600"></span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold font-display text-navy-950 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Built on Trust. <br />
        <span class="text-emerald-700 font-editorial-serif italic font-normal">Driven by Operational Discipline.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 font-normal leading-relaxed pt-1">
        In cross-border commerce, trust is demonstrated through compliance, clear agreements, and meticulous execution. We adhere to transparent trading standards at every milestone.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Structured Credibility Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8" data-reveal-group data-reveal-stagger="80">
      
      <!-- 1. Technical Verification -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-navy-950 mb-2">Technical Verification</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Pre-shipment batch testing, laboratory assays, and specification alignment ensuring zero deviation from buyer tolerances.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Incoterms & Trade Compliance -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-navy-950 mb-2">Incoterms Clarity</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          FOB, CIF, CFR, and DDP commercial contract structures defined with complete transparency on freight, duties, and risk transfers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Direct Sourcing Origins -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-navy-950 mb-2">Producer Direct</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Direct engagement with accredited farm aggregators, milling facilities, and manufacturers, eliminating unnecessary intermediary costs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Dedicated Trade Officers -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-navy-950 mb-2">Dedicated Trade Liaison</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Single-point operational contact providing real-time production updates, customs filing status, and freight milestone tracking.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Assurance Quote Banner -->
    <div class="mt-14 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy-900 to-navy-950 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 border border-navy-800 shadow-xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 scroll-reveal stagger-1">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-champagne font-bold">
          Our Operational Standard
        </div>
        <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold leading-snug">
          "Commercial precision at the source. Certainty at the destination port."
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 max-w-xl">
          We build lasting trading partnerships on the foundation of verified quality, transparent pricing, and dependable logistics execution.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="trade-btn-primary"
        >
          <span>Initiate Trade Dialogue</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
